  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In triangle <math alttext=\"upper X upper Y upper Z\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>X</mi>\n\t<mi>Y</mi>\n\t<mi>Z</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, angle <math alttext=\"upper Y\"><mi>Y</mi>\n</math> is a right angle, the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper Z\"><mi>Z</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"33 degree\"><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, and the length of <math alttext=\"line segment upper Y upper Z\"><mover><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> is <math alttext=\"26\"><mn>26</mn>\n</math> units. If the area, in square units, of triangle <math alttext=\"upper X upper Y upper Z\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>X</mi>\n\t<mi>Y</mi>\n\t<mi>Z</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"k tangent 33 degree\"><mi>k</mi><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, where <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is a constant, what is the value of <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
